{"ID":"20240506100124-bsje1si","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506100124-bsje1si","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100124-bsje1si\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627160302-j6vmizf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612155917-0qehw46\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627160132-rkzju02\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"258粉锡（铅粉）","updated":"20240627160132"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240627160302-j6vmizf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627160302-j6vmizf","updated":"20240627160302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627160302-cqfmcxh.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627160132-rkzju02","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627160132-rkzju02","updated":"20240627160132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 329px;","style":"width: 319px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"铅粉"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/铅粉-20240627160132-aenngrt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 319px;\" parent-style=\"width: 329px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612155803-wsefqok","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155803-wsefqok"}},{"ID":"20240612160113-j6076yn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612160113-j6076yn","updated":"20240612160118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉锡《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612160113-cxn0cf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160113-cxn0cf3","updated":"20240612160113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160113-i6l9qvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160113-i6l9qvl","updated":"20240612160113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主伏尸毒螯，杀三虫。一名解锡，锡镜鼻。主女子血闭，症瘕，伏肠，绝孕。生山谷（旧作二种，今并）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160113-qphrwz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160113-qphrwz0","updated":"20240612160113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生桂阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160113-ly2u8um","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160113-ly2u8um","updated":"20240612160113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：锡银铅之间也"}]},{"ID":"20240612155803-6x6gksv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155803-6x6gksv"}},{"ID":"20240612155821-vb8cn1l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155821-vb8cn1l","updated":"20240612155826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉锡《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155821-t41swpw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155821-t41swpw","updated":"20240612155821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛寒。主伏尸毒螫。杀三虫。一名解锡。锡镜鼻。主女子血闭。症瘕伏肠绝孕。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155821-9bq8ye3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155821-9bq8ye3","updated":"20240612155821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅质银光。生香和粉。糟瓮悬蒸。风炉扇紧。裂鼻通精。照心开蕴。为贼为媒。救裁准。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155821-n2hs2bs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155821-n2hs2bs","updated":"20240612155821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"说文注。银色而铅质也。庾信诗。和粉杂生香。桂海虞衡志。以黑铅着糟瓮中罨化之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155821-hh47bwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155821-hh47bwn","updated":"20240612155821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"谓之桂粉。李时珍曰。铅锡一类也。熔片安水甑内。盐泥固济。风炉安火封养。即成粉。姜质赋。裂鼻之芬。子华子。肺之精其窍上通于鼻。古镜铭。照心照胆保千春。元乐章。提纲开蕴。土宿指南。五金之中。独锡易制。失其药则为贼。得其药则为媒。梁简文帝论。救头痛之。裴度书。有所裁准。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155803-wojz5yg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155803-wojz5yg"}},{"ID":"20240612155804-ai81440","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155804-ai81440","updated":"20240612155809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉锡《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155804-wvlcpy3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155804-wvlcpy3","updated":"20240612160249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，寒，无毒。主伏尸毒螫，杀三虫，去鳖瘕，疗恶疮，堕胎，止小便利。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160027-1audqfm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612160027-1audqfm"}},{"ID":"20240612160028-pb3vyeu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612160028-pb3vyeu","updated":"20240612160034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉锡《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240612160028-8t821lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160028-8t821lr","updated":"20240612160028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉锡、胡粉也，又名定粉。止泄痢、积聚及久痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160039-deryqbi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612160039-deryqbi"}},{"ID":"20240612160040-smrp42y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612160040-smrp42y","updated":"20240612160044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅粉《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612160040-n5na4zc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160040-n5na4zc","updated":"20240612160040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味辛寒，无毒。主治伏尸，毒螫，杀三虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160040-0r0ouv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160040-0r0ouv9","updated":"20240612160040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（因化铅而成粉，故名铅粉。《本经》名粉锡，《别录》名胡粉，今名水粉。李时珍曰∶铅锡一类也，古人名铅为黑锡，故名粉锡。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612160040-y3mul28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160040-y3mul28","updated":"20240612160040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伏尸者，伏于泉下之尸，相 而为传尸鬼疰之病。铅粉从黑变白，从阴出阳，故主治伏尸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160040-lgx76dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160040-lgx76dm","updated":"20240612160040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禀水气而性寒，故消螫毒。禀金气而味辛，故杀三虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160040-299hiew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160040-299hiew","updated":"20240612160040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"愚按∶黄丹、铅粉皆本黑锡所成，而变化少有不同。变白者，得金水之气而走气分。变赤者，得火土之气而走血分。黄丹禀火土之气，故入膏丹，主痈疽恶疮之用。今时则用铅粉收膏药。以代黄丹。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160048-47yfba8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612160048-47yfba8"}},{"ID":"20240612160051-tmevx50","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612160051-tmevx50","updated":"20240612160055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅粉《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612160051-zo7y8zq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160051-zo7y8zq","updated":"20240612160051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅粉有毒味辛寒，恶疮狐臭水能干，消积杀虫止溺痢，破瘀堕胎亦可餐，诸疮可用煎膏贴，油十粉四滴成丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160051-z0ga1yy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160051-z0ga1yy","updated":"20240612160051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即今化铅所作水粉也。其有金色者，名蜡子粉，又名粉锡、定粉、胡粉。丹溪谓∶古俗妇人用以容面，不可入药。今市皆铅粉，容面、入药两用之。治痈肿 烂，疮中出水，汤火，干湿癣疮，及股内阴下常湿痒且臭，小儿疳疮，耳后月蚀，诸狐臭，或干糁，或猪脂、牛脂调敷之。治积聚不消，去鳖瘕，疗小儿疳气，杀三虫，止小便利及久痢，逐瘀血抢心，堕胎，和水或鸡子白调服。凡使，蒸熟，炒令色变。制硫黄，可为外柜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160051-frk7fzv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160051-frk7fzv","updated":"20240612160051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煎膏药法∶用真麻油十两，入锅内煎至烟起，入头发一团，待发化尽，却入药煎枯，滤去渣，慢火煎至滴水成珠不散，退火入炒，过铅粉四两，百草霜四两，以桃枝搅匀，提起听用。凡煎膏，药一两，油二两。用滤过松香煎者，油一两，松香四两；用炒过黄丹煎者，油一两，黄丹七钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155809-fiaey3g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155809-fiaey3g"}},{"ID":"20240612155832-1s0v7bb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155832-1s0v7bb","updated":"20240612155837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉锡《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155832-r9gqoxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155832-r9gqoxa","updated":"20240612155832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，寒，无毒。主伏尸毒螫，杀三虫。去鳖瘕，疗恶疮，堕胎，止小便利。一名解锡。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155832-j6lkg05","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155832-j6lkg05","updated":"20240612155832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即今化铅所作胡粉也。其有金色者，疗尸虫弥良，而谓之粉锡，事与经乖。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155832-vmlsopy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155832-vmlsopy","updated":"20240612155832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕铅丹、胡粉，实用锡造。陶今又言化铅作之，经云粉锡，亦为深误。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160009-wn0f7cv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612160009-wn0f7cv"}},{"ID":"20240612160010-20xnjwg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-20xnjwg","updated":"20240612160015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅粉《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-dl3cyld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-dl3cyld","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化铅为之变黑而白。古人名铅为黑锡。故名粉锡。又名胡粉官粉光粉水粉定粉瓦粉白粉。金陵杭州韶州辰州皆造之。其色带青。造法。每铅百斤。熔化。削成薄片。卷作筒。安木甑内。甑下甑中各安醋一瓶。外以盐泥固济。纸封甑缝。风炉安火四面。养一七。便扫入水缸内。依旧封养。次次如此。铅尽为度。不尽者炒作黄丹。每粉一斤。入豆粉二两。蛤粉四两。水内搅匀。澄去清水。用细灰按成沟。纸隔数层。置粉于上。将干。截成瓦定形。待干收起。（濒湖）桂林所作铅粉最有名。谓之桂粉。以黑铅着糟瓮中罨化之。（虞衡志）嵩阳产铅。居民多造胡粉。其法铅块悬酒缸内。封固四十九日。开之则化为粉矣。化不白者。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-njjtrlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-njjtrlj","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒为黄丹。黄丹渣为密陀僧。三物收利甚溥。（余冬录）味甘辛。气寒凉。入气分。主积聚不消。疗症瘕。去鳖瘕。治久积痢。坠痰消胀。杀虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-ycqe9go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-ycqe9go","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗恶疮痈肿烂。疮中出水。汤火干湿癣疮。及股内阴下湿痒且臭。诸狐臭。（或干掺或猪脂牛脂调敷之）更治小儿疳气。无辜疳痢。（痢而腹胀曰无辜疳）及疳疮耳后月蚀。内服外敷咸宜。其体用虽与铅及黄丹同。而无硝盐火烧之性。内有豆粉蛤粉杂之。止能入气分。不能入血分。此为稍异。服之大便色黑者。还其本质。所谓色坏还为铅也。亦可入膏药。代黄丹用。（濒湖）久痢成疳者。胡粉和水及鸡子白服。以粪黑为度。为其杀虫而止痢也。（藏器）无辜疳下痢赤白。胡粉熟蒸。熬令色黑。米饮服半钱。小儿腹胀。或腹皮青色。不速治必死。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-tyffg1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-tyffg1x","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胡粉盐熬色变。以摩腹上。小儿丹毒。胡粉唾和。从外至内敷之良。久痢赤白。脐腹撮痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-xi4yybi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-xi4yybi","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"圣饼子。用定粉密陀僧硫黄各三钱。黄丹二钱。轻粉少许。为末。入白面四钱匕。滴水丸如指头大。捻成饼。阴干。食前温浆水磨下。大便黑色为效。休息痢羸瘦。黄连去须为末。定粉研。各半两。大枣二十枚。去核舂如泥。铺纸上。入二味药裹之。烧令通赤。取出候冷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-4s777uo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-4s777uo","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"细研。每服使精羊肉半斤。切片。掺散药三钱于上。湿纸裹。烧熟。放冷食之效。腹中鳖症。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-f4jglze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-f4jglze","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胡粉黍米淋汁。温服大效。妇人心痛急者。官粉为末。葱汁和丸小豆大。每服七丸。黄酒下即止。火烧疮。胡粉和羊髓涂上封之。干湿癣。胡臭。若股内阴下常湿且臭。或作疮。以定粉一物掺之瘥。齿缝出血。胡粉半两。麝香半钱。为末。卧时揩牙。从高坠扑。瘀血抢心。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-8jz5kim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-8jz5kim","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"面青气短欲死。胡粉一钱。和水服即安。接骨续筋。止痛活血。定粉当归各一钱。硼砂钱半。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-lkz7x0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-lkz7x0o","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为末。每服一钱。苏木煎汤调下。仍频饮汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-3hqyjpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-3hqyjpf","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕铅本阴寒重坠之性质。蒸罨为粉。由黑而白。是变化奇矣。第其法或安醋瓶于内。或着糟。或悬酒缸中。皆假其气以成变化。致重坠之质轻。阴寒之气和。且色黑化白。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-gjs88lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-gjs88lc","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是金在水中者出现金相。以为气分之用。故能消积聚。疗症瘕。盖积聚即阴气凝结之所致。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-cb3fj2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-cb3fj2p","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而症瘕又即积聚之久而成形者也。此味根至阴而有变化。以达夫阴气。故奏效如此。如小儿疳病。类由于脾阴大伤。阴气伤则有积。积滞不能化。类下恶物而为疳痢。久则化而为虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-sjlg260","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-sjlg260","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"故能治积聚症瘕者。即其能治小儿疳气。并炒焦能止疳痢而杀三虫者也。凡久痢赤白。脐腹撮痛。及休息痢羸瘦者。为有久积未消之故。非从至阴而有变化之气如兹粉者。不能奏同气相求之功。第阴气为病。即已不离血分矣。濒湖乃谓止入气分者。宜指血中之气而言。盖凡有形而成积聚者。皆血之病也。若离血以言气。则人身岂有分离之气血哉。虽能消疳逐积。"}]},{"ID":"20240612160010-4dsl44x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612160010-4dsl44x","updated":"20240612160010"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"杀虫止痢。然其性冷。走而不守。脾胃虚弱者不宜用。娠妇忌之。（仲淳）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155952-2g7vzwn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155952-2g7vzwn"}},{"ID":"20240612155953-9y2cso9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155953-9y2cso9","updated":"20240612160001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉锡《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155953-aoqceve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155953-aoqceve","updated":"20240612155953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．去鳖瘕，治恶疮，堕胎，止小便利．"}]},{"ID":"20240612155953-b6unbge","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155953-b6unbge","updated":"20240612155953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶粉锡，味辛，寒．主伏尸毒螫，杀三虫．一名解锡．"}]},{"ID":"20240612155941-o5ntfdn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155941-o5ntfdn"}},{"ID":"20240612155942-c9qys1r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155942-c9qys1r","updated":"20240612155946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"铅粉《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155942-5qbmkiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155942-5qbmkiq","updated":"20240612155942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即粉锡，一名胡粉，又名水粉"}]},{"ID":"20240612155942-c840bsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155942-c840bsv","updated":"20240612155942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"恶雌黄，制硫黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155942-fxtl3kt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155942-fxtl3kt","updated":"20240612155942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，寒。入足少阴经气分。镇心安神，坠痰消症，杀虫止痢，疗疮拍汗。得葱汁和丸，治妇黍米淋汁温服，治鳖瘕。配黄连，敷燕口吻疮。和盐熬色变，摩小儿腹胀，及腹皮青色。（不速反胃呕哕者，火气上浮，阴阳将离也。得此镇坠之品，加入补阴之剂，俾阳火归元，吐病自止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155832-actrozd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155832-actrozd"}},{"ID":"20240612155842-24kcho7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155842-24kcho7","updated":"20240612155849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉锡《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155842-qxcqrcj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155842-qxcqrcj","updated":"20240612155842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛，寒，无毒。主伏尸毒螫，杀三虫，去鳖瘕，疗恶疮，堕胎，止小便利。一名解锡。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155842-i28tstf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155842-i28tstf","updated":"20240612155842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶即今化铅所作胡粉也。其有金色者，疗尸虫弥良，而谓之粉锡，事与经乖。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155842-ma7qziq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155842-ma7qziq","updated":"20240612155842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本注云∶铅丹、胡粉，实用锡造。陶今言化铅作之，《经》云粉锡，亦为误矣。今注按《本经》呼为粉锡，然其实铅粉也。故英公序云∶铅、锡莫辨者，盖谓此也。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶胡粉，使，又名定粉。味甘、辛，无毒。能治积聚不消，焦炒，止小儿疳痢。陈藏器云∶胡粉，本功外，主久痢成疳。和水及鸡子白服，以粪黑为度，为其杀虫而止痢也。日华子云∶光粉，凉，无毒。治痈肿 烂，呕逆，疗症瘕，小儿疳气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155842-47kugar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155842-47kugar","updated":"20240612155842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具铅条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155842-d1rt0nu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155842-d1rt0nu","updated":"20240612155842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"外台秘要∶误吞钱并金银物。以胡粉一两，捣调之，分再服食水银金如泥，吞金银物在腹中，服之令消洋出之。千金方∶治疮中水。胡粉、炭灰白等分，脂和涂孔上，水即止。又方∶治诸腋臭。胡粉三合，以牛脂和，煎令可丸，涂之。肘后方∶治笃病新起早劳，食饮多致复欲死方∶水服胡粉少许。《伤寒类要》同。又方∶治卒从高落下，瘀血抢心，面青短气欲死方∶胡粉一钱匕，和水服之，即瘥。孙真人食忌∶治火烧疮，以胡粉、羊髓和涂上，封之。食医心镜∶治小儿舌上疮。取胡粉末并猪 骨中髓敷之，日三度。张文仲∶治干湿癣等及阴下常湿且臭，或作疮。但以胡粉一物粉之，除即瘥止，常用大验。《肘后方》同。又方∶治寸白虫。熬胡粉令速燥，平旦作肉 ，以药方寸匕纳 中，服之有大效。又方∶小儿疳疮。胡粉熬八分，猪脂和涂之，瘥为度，油亦得。子母秘录∶小儿夜啼。胡粉服水调三豆大，日三服。又方∶小儿腹胀。胡粉盐熬色变，以摩腹上，兼治腹皮青。若不理，须臾死。又方∶治小儿无辜痢赤白兼成疳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155842-jj9h8wf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155842-jj9h8wf","updated":"20240612155842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胡粉熟蒸，熬令色变，以饮服之。又方∶治小儿耳后月蚀疮，胡粉和土涂上。丹房镜源云∶胡粉可制硫黄，亦可用外柜。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155842-abvh7h8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155842-abvh7h8","updated":"20240612155842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶粉锡，胡粉也，又名定粉。止泄痢，积聚及久痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155843-5vexo7i","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155843-5vexo7i"}},{"ID":"20240612155857-jips9d0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-jips9d0","updated":"20240612155904"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉锡《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-kmj112p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-kmj112p","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」即铅粉，又有解锡、铅华、定粉、瓦粉、光粉、水粉、白粉、官粉、胡粉等名。旧日妇女用来擦脸。古人称铅为黑。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-i1609sz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-i1609sz","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」辛、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-w3525dy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-w3525dy","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-5e35ol0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-5e35ol0","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、劳复与食复（按：大病初愈，尚未恢复，便有性交，引起发烧、便赤、卵肿或缩入等症状，叫做“劳复”。因贪食而旧病复发，叫做“食复”）。用粉锡少许，水冲服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-tgeycqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-tgeycqd","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、小儿脾泄不止。用红枣二十个，去核，将粉锡填入，在瓦上烘干，去枣留粉，再研细。每服三分，米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-gvaxeoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-gvaxeoq","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、赤白痢。用粉锡一两，调鸡蛋清，和灸烘焦，研细。每次用冷水冲服一钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-0k36ly1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-0k36ly1","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、小儿疳痢（按：由疳疾引起，时痢时止。痢时，红白兼有，全身黄瘦）。用粉锡先蒸后熬，等变色时，每服半钱，米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-nf9h4ru","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-nf9h4ru","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、小儿腹胀。用盐熬粉锡，等变色后，即取以摩擦腹部。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-mc5njw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-mc5njw6","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、小儿肚皮变青，极为危险。用上法可治好。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-axkxx5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-axkxx5u","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、小儿夜啼不止。用粉锡如三粒豆子那样大的量，水冲服。一天服三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-lmt8jpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-lmt8jpz","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、身热多汗。用粉锡半斤、雷丸四两，共研细，当作扑粉扑身。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-lnqjpp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-lnqjpp1","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、绦虫蛔虫。用少量粉锡，炒后放在肉汤里空心服下，大效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-gtmkrul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-gtmkrul","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、鼻血不止。用醋炒粉锡，服一钱，即见效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-faadpts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-faadpts","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11、齿缝出血。用粉锡半两、麝香半钱，卧时擦牙。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-x2x70s8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-x2x70s8","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12、跌打瘀血。用粉锡一钱，和水冲服。虽脸青、气短、欲死者亦有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-6tidohu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-6tidohu","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13、跌打断骨。用粉锡、硼砂等分，研细。每服一钱，苏木汤送下。宜多饮苏木汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-k91zx5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-k91zx5l","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14、面皮抓伤。用香油调粉锡搽患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-z2mx9dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-z2mx9dl","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"15、打伤后肿痛成疮。用粉锡一两、生赤石脂一钱、水银一分，拌麻油，调成膏，摊在油纸上贴佃处。脱肉的地方，可有膏填满，再包扎好。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-bz54jb6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-bz54jb6","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16、黄水脓疮。用粉锡煅黄三钱，加松香三钱、黄丹一钱、细矾二钱，共研为末。倒入香油二两，熬成膏子涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-55717ac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-55717ac","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17、口角生疮。用炒粉锡一分、黄连半两，共研为末，搽患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-281r18z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-281r18z","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"18、翻花恶疮（按：疮内有米粒状小颗，破则出血），翻出于外，故称翻花）。用粉锡一两、胭脂一两，共研为末。在盐水洗净患处后，即将药搽上。一天搽五次。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-gi16jij","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-gi16jij","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"19、蜂巢疮。用粉锡、朱砂等分，研细，调蜜搽疮上。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-lni624s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-lni624s","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20、汤火伤。用羊子骨髓调粉锡涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-3pjzmjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-3pjzmjn","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"22、蠼螋尿疮（按：此疮初起如粟，渐大如豆，后成浆泡，恶汗流出，疼痛难忍，同时有轻度发热和全身不适等症状。陈藏器还说：这种疮能绕腰生长。看来很可能是“带状泡疹”）。用醋调粉锡涂搽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-62wpb6t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-62wpb6t","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"23、诸蛇咬伤。用粉锡和大蒜捣如泥，涂伤口。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-7hjuvvp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-7hjuvvp","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"24、目翳。用粉锡点翳上，有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-w944hpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-w944hpq","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"25、口干无津。用公猪胆五个，酒煮，到胆囊破烂时，加粉锡一两，研匀，做成丸子，如芡子大。每次含一丸，咽汁吞下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-xlcf2sj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-xlcf2sj","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"26、腹中鳖症（按：此病是腹中有硬块，或肿起外突，如鳖伏身）。用黍米淋汁冲粉锡湿服，大效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155857-1n81j0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155857-1n81j0v","updated":"20240612155857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"27、背疮、背痛。用粉锡二两、麻油三两，慢火熬，同时用柳枝急搅。到滴汗成珠时，加白胶末少许，放入水盆中浸两日，取出摊油纸上贴患处。此方名“神应膏”。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155858-h7nmxi6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155858-h7nmxi6"}},{"ID":"20240612155914-7w3aekb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-7w3aekb","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《全国中草药汇编》：铅粉"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-1h0f7xo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-1h0f7xo","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-4acs4ay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-4acs4ay","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qiān Fěn"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-w7vbbvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-w7vbbvr","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ck1npqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ck1npqd","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 官粉、粉锡"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-9u96r3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-9u96r3p","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-2ov18ot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-2ov18ot","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 加工品。原料为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"铅"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"醋酸"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-sckyfj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-sckyfj7","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-yis1z2r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-yis1z2r","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 广东。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ufx4o56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ufx4o56","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-nk41znh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-nk41znh","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 祛湿，消肿败毒。外用治痈疽恶疮，杖疮肿毒，黄水脓疮，血风臁疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ibnnsje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ibnnsje","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-urtsu0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-urtsu0a","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ihas753","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ihas753","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：铅粉"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ome3cfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ome3cfq","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-rrebr4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-rrebr4k","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qiān Fěn"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-czxpdv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-czxpdv0","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-a95oeai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-a95oeai","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 粉锡、解锡（《本经》），水粉（《范子计然》），胡粉（《参同契》），定粉（《药性论》），锡粉、流丹、鹊粉、白膏、铅白（《石药尔雅》），光粉（《日华子本草》），白粉、瓦粉（《汤液本草》），铅华、官粉（《纲目》），宫粉（《药材学》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-j64nq4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-j64nq4s","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-fmzc0pb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-fmzc0pb","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《开宝本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-d2b6ln5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-d2b6ln5","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-8iciw11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-8iciw11","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"铅加工制成的碱式碳酸铅"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-06smioe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-06smioe","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-8vyq89w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-8vyq89w","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为白色的粉末，或凝聚成不规则的块状，手捻之立即成粉，有细而滑腻感。质重。以色白细腻，无杂质者为佳。不溶于水及酒精.能溶于碳酸水及稀硝酸。遇硫离子则变黑色。在闭管中燃烧则生水，在木炭上燃烧则生铅粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-olkqwe9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-olkqwe9","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-q4zvav3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-q4zvav3","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《得配本草》：\"入足少阴经气分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-9papwap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-9papwap","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-z77s9ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-z77s9ui","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘辛，寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-cjxt87b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-cjxt87b","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味辛，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-xn9chs2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-xn9chs2","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"味甘辛，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-b3do9jy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-b3do9jy","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《医学入门》：\"味辛，寒，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-p7dkfdw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-p7dkfdw","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-m09w0tv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-m09w0tv","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服宜慎，脏腑虚寒者及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-84ljnir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-84ljnir","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》：\"雌黄得胡粉而失色，胡粉得雌黄而色黑，盖相恶也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-d9uay95","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-d9uay95","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"脾胃虚弱者不宜用。妊妇忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-9l078fq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-9l078fq","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-5ys9vlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-5ys9vlj","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 消积，杀虫，解毒，生肌。治疳积，下痢，虫积腹痛，症瘕，疟疾，疥癣，痈疽，溃疡，口疮，丹毒，烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-yrrroqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-yrrroqj","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主毒蟹，杀三虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-9vs66lu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-9vs66lu","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"去鳖瘕，疗恶疮，堕胎，止小便利。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-dqre8g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-dqre8g7","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"治积聚不消，炒焦止小儿疳痢。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-69wruiz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-69wruiz","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"治痈肿瘘烂，呕逆，疗症瘕，小儿疳气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-esij9gy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-esij9gy","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》：\"治食复，劳复，坠痰消胀；治疥癣狐臭，黑须发。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-1g412vy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-1g412vy","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《医林纂要》：\"软坚行痰，杀虫镇惊。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-w2r97lj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-w2r97lj","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-er2izsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-er2izsn","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用；研束干撒或调敷，或熬膏贴。内服：研末，3～5分；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-nv2l8km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-nv2l8km","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-dmmrmoa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-dmmrmoa","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疳痢、五色痢：定粉、龙骨、黄丹（煅过）各二钱，诃子三个（煨热，取肉）。上为末。每服一至二分，粥饮下。（《幼科准绳》定粉散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ffw44hk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ffw44hk","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治小儿脾泄不止：红枣二十个，去核，将官粉入内，以阴阳瓦焙干，去枣研粉。每服一至二分，米汤下。（《孙真人集效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-emrhgz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-emrhgz7","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治小儿谷道虫痒：胡粉、雄黄等分。着中。（《子母秘录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ejwqwzj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ejwqwzj","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治瘑疥疮有虫：胡粉（研）三两，水银二两，皂荚十挺（椎，以水浸挪，滤取浓汁一升）。先熬皂荚汁至五合，下粉、水银，以柳篦搅令匀，瓷合盛。先以盐汤洗疮，取涂摩疮上，日三、五次。（《圣济总录》胡粉膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-0ygfytz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-0ygfytz","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治干癣痒不止：胡粉、黄连（去须）、蛇床子、白蔹各半两。捣罗为末，面脂调涂，湿即干贴之。（《圣惠方》胡粉散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-64ykltz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-64ykltz","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治痈疽发背恶疮：光粉二两，真麻油三两。慢火同熬，更换柳枝频搅，至滴水成珠，入白胶末少许，徐徐倾入磁器内，以水浸二日，油纸摊贴。（《仁斋直指方》神应膏）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-avinlil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-avinlil","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治妒精阴疮：铅粉二钱，银杏仁七个。铜铫内炒至杏黄，去杏取粉，出火毒，研搽。（《频湖集简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-gqez5bt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-gqez5bt","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治血风臁疮：官粉四两。水调入碗内，以蕲州艾叶烧烟熏干，入乳香少许，同研，香油调作隔纸膏，反复贴之。（《孙天仁集效方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ebxflg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ebxflg5","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治熛疮，浸淫多汁，日就浸大：胡粉（熬）、甘草（炙）、闾茹、黄连各二分。四物捣散，筛，以粉疮，日三。（《刘涓子鬼遗方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-0bsynb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-0bsynb1","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治黄水脓疮：官粉（煅黄）、松香各三钱，黄丹一钱，飞矾二钱。为末，香油二两，熬膏敷之。（《秘传经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-294trch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-294trch","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治火烧疮：胡粉、羊髓和，涂上封之。（《孙真人食忌》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-1w0g1mb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-1w0g1mb","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿接骨续筋，止痛活血：定粉、当归各-钱，硼砂一钱半。为末。每服一钱，苏木煎汤调下，仍频饮汤。（《卫生易简方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-wi5ny7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-wi5ny7j","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治牙宣血出不止：胡粉半两，麝香（研）半钱。上二味同研为细散，临卧净揩牙，漱口讫，干贴，兼能牢牙。（《圣济总录》胡粉散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-rvxqw8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-rvxqw8a","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-1gs5eo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-1gs5eo2","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经疏》：\"粉锡体用与铅相似，性善杀虫，故去三虫鳖瘕。寒能解热毒，故疗怒疮毒螫。重而下降，故能堕胎。涩而粘腻，故止小便利。甄权主积聚不消，炒焦止小儿疳痢；藏器主久痢成疳，和鸡子白服，以粪黑为度，皆为其消积杀虫止痢也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-32e9lr0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-32e9lr0","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"制法"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-g5yt7yt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-g5yt7yt","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 将卷叠的铅板，放入木桶，置于盛稀醋酸的磁锅上，用炭火徐徐加热，经较长时间，铅受醋酸蒸气的作用，先成碱式醋酸铅，再逢无水碳酸，而成碱式碳酸铅，即为铅粉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-9z0q0ig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-9z0q0ig","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《纲目》：\"每铅百斤，熔化、削成薄片，卷作筒，安木甑内，甑下甑中，各安醋一瓶，外以盐泥固济，纸封甑缝，风炉安火四两，养一七，便扫入水缸内，依旧封养，次次如此，铅尽为度，不尽者，留炒作黄丹。每粉一斤，入豆粉二两，蛤粉四两，水内搅匀，澄去清水，用细灰按成沟，纸隔数层，置粉于上，将干，截成瓦定形，待干收起。《相感志》云：韶粉蒸之不白，以萝卜瓮子蒸之则白。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-jnmshmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-jnmshmz","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-fmhqv0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-fmhqv0x","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-bxkrm5v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-bxkrm5v","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：铅粉"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-pdnp2fc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-pdnp2fc","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-5lbwmlg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-5lbwmlg","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Qiān Fěn"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-tvjezh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-tvjezh3","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-k6v3glo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-k6v3glo","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 粉锡、解锡、水粉、胡粉、定粉、锡粉、丹地黄、流丹、鹊粉、流丹白毫、白膏、铅白、光粉、白粉、瓦粉、铅华、官粉、宫粉"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ys9ghpo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ys9ghpo","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-l6ghfui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-l6ghfui","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" lead-powder， white lead"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-f8tw51q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-f8tw51q","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-vdd6hfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-vdd6hfb","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《开宝本草》。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-efls3hb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-efls3hb","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《桂海虞衡志》：铅粉，桂州所作最有名，谓之桂粉，其粉以黑铅着糟瓮罨化之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-vwrzrja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-vwrzrja","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《余冬录》：嵩阳因产铅之故也，居民多制胡粉为业。其法铅块悬酒缸内封闭之，四十九日始开，则铅化为粉矣。化弗白者，炒为黄丹。黄丹渣为密陀僧。然其铅气有毒，制者必食犬肉，饮酒以御之，若枵腹中其毒气，辄病至死。业久之家，长幼为毒熏蒸，多痿黄，旋致风挛瘫软之疾，不得其寿而毙。)3.《纲目》：胡粉"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-uop5bdu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-uop5bdu","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-c4un44v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-c4un44v","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为用铅加工制成的碱式碳酸铅。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-95r58pf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-95r58pf","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名："}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ful1lbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ful1lbb","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-uwiqk7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-uwiqk7o","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主产广东佛山，其他地区亦生产。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-oxmrvsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-oxmrvsf","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-xlo5xa8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-xlo5xa8","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品为白色粉末，有时聚成块状，但手捻即散。不透明。体重，质细腻润滑，手触之染指。无臭，味酸。不溶于水及酒精，能溶于碳酸及稀硝酸。以色白、细腻润滑、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-18ywuri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-18ywuri","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-uh5cuec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-uh5cuec","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主要成分为碱式碳酸铅，多以2PbCO3·Pb(OH)2表示。但由于制法不同，组成也时有变化，如以XPbCO3·Pb(OH)2表示，X可从1.88至2.72。因原料铅常含杂质，故制成的铅粉，亦含杂质，常见的有铁、银、铜、砷、锑、锡等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-uxj1fe7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-uxj1fe7","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-nncsh6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-nncsh6v","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 能使蛋白质沉淀而起收敛、制泌的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-louuq9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-louuq9k","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性 成人经口致死量40-50g，豚鼠口服最小致死量约0.14g/kg;家兔静注致死量4mg/kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-3xawmvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-3xawmvc","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-slf62wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-slf62wa","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (1)取本品约0.5g，加稀硝酸约5ml，立即产生大量气体；将此气体通入氢氧化钙试液中，即变成白色混浊液体。（检查碳酸盐）(2)取上述反应后的溶液，滤过。取滤液1ml滴加碘化钾试液，即生成黄色沉淀；此沉淀溶于热水，冷后又析出黄色结晶。（检查铅盐）(3)取上述滤液1ml,滴加铬酸钾试液，即生成黄色沉淀；沉淀在氢氧化铵试液或2mol/L稀硝酸中均不溶解；而溶解于2mol/L氢氧化钠试液。（检查铅盐）(4)取本品粉末约1g，置密闭试管中，灼烧，则有水生成。（检查化合水）"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-29e35i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-29e35i6","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-g3v804o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-g3v804o","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肺；肾；脾经"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-fjwt5zo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-fjwt5zo","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-bfy70ga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-bfy70ga","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘；辛；寒；有毒"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-00u2odm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-00u2odm","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-prfsez1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-prfsez1","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服宣慎，脏腑虚寒者及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-6quhlvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-6quhlvl","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《纲目》：雌黄得胡粉而失色，胡粉得雌黄而色黑，盖相恶也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-58f0hts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-58f0hts","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：脾胃虚弱者不宜用。妊妇忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-1ztbfca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-1ztbfca","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-40c4emt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-40c4emt","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 消积；杀虫；解毒；生肌；燥湿止痒。主疳积；虫积腹痛；痢疾；症瘕；疟疾；疥癣；痈疽溃疡；湿疹；口疮；丹毒；烫伤；狐臭"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-1zhyowq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-1zhyowq","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ugilak6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ugilak6","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用：研末干撒或调敷，或熬膏贴。内服：研末，0.9-1.5g，或入丸、散，不入煎剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-njpdnnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-njpdnnf","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-r12qjat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-r12qjat","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疳痢、五色痢：定粉、龙骨、黄丹(煅过)各二钱，诃子三个(煨熟，取肉)。上为末。每服一至二分，粥饮下。(《幼科准绳》定粉散)②治小儿脾泄不止：红枣二十个，去核，将官粉入内，以阴阳瓦焙干，去枣研粉。每服一至二分，米汤下。《孙真人集效方》)③治小儿谷道虫痒：胡粉、雄黄等分。着中。(《子母秘录》。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-mrhlkbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-mrhlkbo","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治牙宣血出不止：胡粉半两，麝香(研)半钱。上二味同研为细散，临卧净揩牙，漱口讫，干贴，兼能牢牙。(《圣济总录》胡粉散)⑤治干癣痒不止：胡粉、黄连(去须)、蛇床子、白蔹各半两。捣罗为末，面脂调涂，湿即干贴之。(《圣惠方》胡粉散)⑥治痈疽发背恶疮：光粉二两，真麻油三两。慢火同熬，更换柳枝频搅，至滴水成殊，入白胶末少许，徐徐倾入磁器内，以水浸二日，油纸摊贴。(《仁斋直指方》神应膏)⑦治妒精阴疮：铅粉二钱，银杏仁七个。铜铫内炒至杏黄，去杏取粉，出火毒，研搽。(《频湖集简方》)⑧治血风臁疮：官粉四两。水调入碗内，以蕲州艾叶烧烟熏干，入乳香少许，同研，香油调作隔纸膏，反复贴之。(《孙天仁集效方》)⑨接骨续筋，止痛活血：定粉、当归各一钱，硼砂一钱半。为末。每服一钱，苏木煎汤调下，仍频饮汤。(《卫生易简方》)⑩治黄水脓疮：官粉(煅黄)、松香各三钱，黄丹一钱，飞矾二钱。为末，香油二两，熬膏敷之。(《秘传经验方》)11.治火烧疮：胡粉、羊髓和，涂上封之。(《孙真人食忌》)"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-ewul4i4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-ewul4i4","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-6imqxjo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-6imqxjo","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主毒螫，杀三虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-v4l5qog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-v4l5qog","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：去鳖瘕，疗恶疮，堕胎，止小便利。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-3zjhkja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-3zjhkja","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性论》：治积聚不消，炒焦止小儿疳痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-3pnv330","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-3pnv330","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《日华子本草》：治痈肿瘘烂，呕逆，疗症瘕，小儿疳气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-vm3lfbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-vm3lfbc","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《纲目》：治食复，劳复，坠痰消胀；治疥癣狐臭，黑须发。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-la9hy1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-la9hy1m","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《医林纂要》：软坚行痰，杀虫镇惊。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-c8fnck8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-c8fnck8","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草经疏》：粉锡体用与铅相似，性善杀虫，故去三虫鳖瘕。寒能解热毒，故疗恶疮毒螫。重而下降，故能堕胎。涩而粘腻，故止小便利。甄权主积聚不消，炒焦止小儿疳痢；藏器主久痢成疳，和鸡子白服，以粪黑为度，皆为其消积杀虫止痢也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-sy0dcjk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-sy0dcjk","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612155914-yvqc8mo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155914-yvqc8mo","updated":"20240612155914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612155915-apo1sev","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612155915-apo1sev"}},{"ID":"20240612155917-0qehw46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612155917-0qehw46"}}]}